Step 16: Response Mapper Layer

      Never expose external responses.

            API Response
                  ↓
            Mapper
                  ↓
            Internal DTO
                  ↓
            Frontend

Example :

            @Component
            public class CustomerMapper {
            
                public CustomerDTO map(
                    CustomerApiResponse response) {
            
                    return CustomerDTO.builder()
                            .name(
                                response.getCustomerName())
