5. Template Method Pattern (Optional Enhancement)

Common API flow:

            Validate Request
            ↓
            Call API
            ↓
            Handle Error
            ↓
            Map Response
            ↓
            Return Result

Abstract class:

            public abstract class BaseApiClient {
                public final Mono<?> execute() {
                    validate();
                    callApi();
                    mapResponse();
                }
            }

Purpose:

      Removes duplicated code across API clients.

